{"version":1,"key":"card:103","content":{"id":103,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"有关文件大小那一列，我们发现它是以字节为单位，我们可能很难马上反应过来有多大，我们可以添加 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"-h","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 选项，以更加人性化的方式显示文件的大小","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cc086d5d-a283-4467-9619-74ec9246f2a7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"# 选项没有先后顺序，-h -l 也是可以的\n~ » ls -l -h\ntotal 32K\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 xt xt  17K Nov  9 16:10 hello\n-rw-r--r-- 1 xt xt  168 Nov  9 15:51 hello.c\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 xt xt 4.0K Nov  9 16:09 math","collabId":"bbe5e56c-71a0-4b87-8d33-70bcbfae78f2","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"28b3c724-238b-4b31-a270-f817889c28ba","language":"bash","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"c1529c26-5d76-48e6-a13e-baa95cfba2d5"},{"children":[{"text":"上面文件的大小就带有单位了，没有单位就表示以字节为单位，它会以合适的单位显示文件的大小，方便我们查看。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6de4af02-c9c3-4f93-bc6a-b63f8b4bf3e2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"calloutType":"tip","children":[{"children":[{"text":"上面我们将选项 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"-l -h","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 分开书写，我们其实还可以将它们合并在一起，所以上面的命令还可以写为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"ls -lh","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"61d076ea-771e-4664-a697-50f1c789732e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"bb2ec17c-e714-4454-bddd-9bc64240a4b7","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"-h","type":"forma